ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi155: Single ADVANCED_FACE on PLANE in CLOSED_SHELL; outer EDGE_LOOP has 4 edges: E0 LINE (0,0,0)→(10,0,0), E1 zero-length LINE (10,0,0)→(10,0,0) magnitude=0 IS the defect, E2 LINE (10,0,0)→(10,10,0), E3 LINE (10,10,0)→(0,0,0); E1 start==end vertex at (10,0,0); CheckGap3d at line 1125 does not guard start==end; direction undefined at zero-length edge IS the mechanism; all EDGE_CURVEs ARE wired into EDGE_LOOP → FACE_OUTER_BOUND → ADVANCED_FACE in CLOSED_SHELL — never orphaned */
